  "title": "Wavelets",
  "html": "<h1>Wavelets</h1><p>Wavelets resolve structure in both location and scale. Compared with global Fourier modes, they describe localized changes through a hierarchy of resolutions.</p><h2 id=\"model\">Problem and representative equations</h2><p>An orthonormal discrete wavelet system expands a function in coarse scaling coefficients c and detail coefficients d. The factor 2ʲ/² preserves the L2 norm of ψⱼ,ₖ. The stated energy identity assumes a complete orthonormal system and compatible boundary treatment.</p><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>f</mi><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>J</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=\\sum_kc_{J,k}\\phi_{J,k}+\\sum_{j\\ge J}\\sum_kd_{j,k}\\psi_{j,k},\\qquad\\|f\\|_2^2=\\sum_k|c_{J,k}|^2+\\sum_{j\\ge J,k}|d_{j,k}|^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin